pr_body:
 - better support all types of typescript enums (numeric, string, heterogeneous) + tests + docs - Fix https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/3393, Fix https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/3072
```typescript

export enum NumericEnum {
    ADMIN,
    EDITOR,
    MODERATOR,
    GHOST
}

export enum StringEnum {
    ADMIN = "a",
    EDITOR = "e",
    MODERATOR = "m",
    GHOST = "g"
}

export enum HeterogeneousEnum {
    NO = 0,
    YES = "YES",
}
```
 - default values for enum array coluns (postgres) could be now defined as array - Fix https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/3323
```typescript
@Column({
    type: "enum",
    enum: StringEnum,
    array: true,
    default: [StringEnum.ADMIN]
})
stringEnums: StringEnum[];
```
 - add enum type to sample - Fix https://github.com/typeorm/typeorm/issues/3392

